  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="1a42bfd9-3d34-54e0-b7c9-9b017c53dcf4" activityNameId="c7701bdf-34b3-5ead-abe0-757e95e324f4" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Photovoltaic panel for PVT, single-Si, without flat glass, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic panel for PVT, single-Si, without flat glass, at plant
Unit process raw data for 1 m2 of PV panel ONLY FOR PVT-SYSTEM! (without flat glass!). Investigated for the production of solar panels and laminates with 60 solar cells a 156*156mm2 (=1.6m2 panel) with a capacity of 224 Wp and a panel efficiency of 14.0%. Cell size and amount and capacity might differ between different producers;
Synonyms: Solarmodul nur für PVT-Systeme, PV-module for PVT systems only, monocrystalline, silicon, WITHOUT FLAT GLASS,; 
UUID: 9e17f0fe-f5ae-4928-8d86-e817035acfcb
Production of the cell matrix, cutting of foils and washing of glass, production of laminate, isolation. Aluminium frame of the panel. Disposal after end of life. Data for direct air and water emissions were not available. It can be expected that small amount of NMVOC will be emitted from the lamination process. WITHOUT flat glass.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Modern production plant.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer,  environmental reports, direct contacts with factory representatives and publication of plant data. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9e17f0fe-f5ae-4928-8d86-e817035acfcb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
